{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"Stripe’s sandbox provisioning is available here, so I created a temporary Stripe test sandbox and obtained test keys for this run. The fulfillment design will be generated server-side as a public SVG URL tied to the exact order timestamp, which matches Prodigi’s requirement for a fetchable artwork asset and avoids sending customer-supplied arbitrary URLs."}}
