i>\n484-            <a href=\"#the-order-process\" class=\"toc-h1 toc-link\" data-title=\"The order process\">The order process</a>\n485-              <ul class=\"toc-list-h2\">\n486-                  <li>\n487-                    <a href=\"#the-order-process-1-order-creation\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"1. Order creation\">1. Order creation</a>\n488-                  </li>\n489-                  <li>\n490:                    <a href=\"#the-order-process-2-assets-download\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"2. Assets download\">2. Assets download</a>\n491-                  </li>\n492-                  <li>\n493-                    <a href=\"#the-order-process-3-lab-allocation\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"3. Lab allocation\">3. Lab allocation</a>\n494-                  </li>\n495-                  <li>\n496-                    <a href=\"#the-order-process-4-asset-preparation\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"4. Asset preparation\">4. Asset preparation</a>\n497-                  </li>\n498-                  <li>\n499-                    <a href=\"#the-order-process-5-lab-submission\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"5. Lab submission\">5. Lab submission</a>\n500-                  </li>\n501-                  <li>\n502-                    <a href=\"#the-order-process-6-production\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"6. Production\">6. Production</a>\n--\n566-</ul>\n567-<h2 id='environments-live'>Live</h2>\n568-<p>Live is our <strong>production</strong> environment. Any orders that are placed here <strong>will be produced and shipped</strong>.</p>\n569-\n570-<ul>\n571-<li>Live API: <strong>api.prodigi.com</strong></li>\n572-<li>Live dashboard: <a href=\"https://dashboard.prodigi.com/\" title=\"Production dashboard\">dashboard.prodigi.com</a></li>\n573-</ul>\n574-\n575-            </section>\n576-            <section class=\"content\">\n577-                <h1 id='authentication'>Authentication</h1><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\">Using the authentication header\n578:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n579-  <span class=\"nt\">-X</span> GET <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n580-  <span class=\"nt\">-H</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"X-API-Key: your-api-key\"</span>\n581-</code></pre></div></div>\n582-<p>Each request to our API requires the use of an authentication header: <code>X-API-Key</code>.</p>\n583-\n584-<p>You can obtain an API key by <a href=\"https://dashboard.prodigi.com/register\" title=\"Sign up for Prodigi\">signing up for a free Prodigi account</a>.</p>\n585-\n586-<aside class=\"notice\">\n587-Your API credentials may differ between Sandbox and Live. If you have issues authenticating, please ensure you are using the correct credentials for that environment.\n588-</aside>\n589-\n590-            </section>\n591-            <section class=\"content\">\n592:                <h1 id='orders'>Orders</h1>\n593-<p>Creating an order is a single API request, supplying all of the relevant information. Once the order is in our system, we will process it according to your account settings, taking into account any configured pause window. Otherwise, we will start to fulfill it immediately.</p>\n594-\n595-                <h2 id='order-object'>Order object</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\">Order object\n596-</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight json tab-json\"><code><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n597-    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"ord_840796\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n598-    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"created\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"2021-03-11T14:31:23.41Z\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n599-    