{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"web_search_instructions":"Search official Prodigi documentation/catalog for current t-shirt product SKUs, especially black short sleeve t-shirts suitable for DTG. Include exact SKU strings, attributes, sizes/variants if available, and source URLs. Prefer official Prodigi docs or API responses over third-party posts.","fast_mode":false},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: Prodigi Black Short Sleeve T-Shirt SKUs for DTG Printing\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nProdigi offers a diverse selection of black short sleeve t-shirts suitable for Direct-to-Garment (DTG) printing. These t-shirts vary in fit, material composition, and size availability, catering to different customer preferences and printing requirements.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** Prodigi provides multiple black short sleeve t-shirt options compatible with DTG printing, including brands like Bella+Canvas, Gildan, and Stanley/Stella.\n\n- **Finding 2:** These t-shirts are available in various fits—ranging from tailored to relaxed—and are made from materials such as 100% combed cotton and organic cotton blends.\n\n- **Finding 3:** Size availability spans from XS to 3XL, accommodating a broad range of body types.\n\n- **Finding 4:** All listed t-shirts are printed using DTG technology, ensuring high-quality, detailed prints suitable for complex designs.\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: Unisex Print on Demand Apparel | Prodigi\n\n- **URL:** [https://www.prodigi.com/products/unisex-apparel/](https://www.prodigi.com/products/unisex-apparel/)\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official Prodigi product listing)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis page showcases Prodigi's unisex apparel collection, highlighting various t-shirt options suitable for DTG printing. Notable black short sleeve t-shirts include the Bella+Canvas 3001, Gildan 2000, and Stanley/Stella Creator 2.0 STTU169. Each t-shirt is described with details on fit, material, and availability.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- **Bella+Canvas 3001:** Tailored fit, crew neck, short sleeves.\n\n- **Gildan 2000:** Classic fit, crew neck, short sleeves.\n\n- **Stanley/Stella Creator 2.0 STTU169:** Regular fit, crew neck, short sleeves.\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Make your designs accessible to everyone with our collection of unisex custom apparel.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Print on Demand T-Shirts - Print API, Dropshipping\n\n- **URL:** [https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/)\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official Prodigi product listing)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis page provides an overview of Prodigi's customizable t-shirts, emphasizing their suitability for DTG printing. It lists various styles, including classic, long sleeve, and tank tops, with specific mention of black short sleeve options like the Bella+Canvas 3001 and Gildan 64000.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- **Bella+Canvas 3001:** Tailored fit, crew neck, short sleeves.\n\n- **Gildan 64000:** Semi-fitted, crew neck, short sleeves.\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Our carefully curated range of premium designer t-shirts are available in an array of on-trend styles and colours.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 3: Print on Demand Classic T-Shirts | Prodigi\n\n- **URL:** [https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/](https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/)\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official Prodigi product listing)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis page details Prodigi's classic t-shirt offerings, focusing on black short sleeve options suitable for DTG printing. It includes information on fit, material composition, and shipping locations for t-shirts like the Bella+Canvas 3001, Gildan 64000, and Stanley/Stella Creator 2.0 STTU169.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- **Bella+Canvas 3001:** Tailored fit, 100% combed and ring-spun cotton.\n\n- **Gildan 64000:** Semi-fitted, 100% cotton.\n\n- **Stanley/Stella Creator 2.0 STTU169:** Regular fit, 100% organic combed cotton.\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Our carefully curated range of premium designer t-shirts are available in an array of on-trend styles and colours.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- All sources confirm that Prodigi offers black short sleeve t-shirts compatible with DTG printing, including models like Bella+Canvas 3001, Gildan 64000, and Stanley/Stella Creator 2.0 STTU169.\n\n- These t-shirts are available in various fits and materials, catering to diverse customer preferences.\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No significant conflicting information was identified across the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- Specific SKU strings for each t-shirt model are not explicitly listed in the provided sources.\n\n- Detailed size charts and variant information for each t-shirt are not comprehensively provided.\n\n---\n\n## Research Metadata\n\n- **Search Completed:** 2026-08-24T06:31:08Z\n\n- **Sources Analyzed:** 3 sources\n\n- **Total Content Reviewed:** Approximately 1,200 words\n\n- **Search Confidence:** High (Based on official Prodigi sources and comprehensive product listings)\n\n--- "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"55d4dcdc-b372-48c1-834a-b1a4d1ab8add"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
